{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>Behold, a master.</b> This is the seventh blessing — and he makes it first? Rather, he said to him: What benefit is a blessing to you? If you acquire property, it is his — for I have set him as a master over you; and whatever a servant acquires, his master acquires." "<b>And you, then, what shall I do.</b> Where, then, shall I seek what to do for you?"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:48.949332433Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}